OL,3,GNEWSAPostbox topper for Remembrance
OL,4,A'goes viral'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCredited with bringing some brightness
OL,7,Fto difficult times, postbox toppers
OL,8,Fhave long had a cult following, with
OL,9,Fthe knitted or crocheted decorations
OL,10,Fespecially gaining popularity during
OL,11,Fthe COVID-19 lockdown periods.
OL,13,FOne recent design, in honour of
OL,14,FRemembrance Day has put the small
OL,15,Fvillage of Allensmore, in
OL,16,FHerefordshire, on the international
OL,17,Fmap.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
