OL,3,GNEWSAPostbox topper for Remembrance
OL,4,A'goes viral'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDepicting uniformed military personnel
OL,7,Fin attendance at Remembrance services,
OL,8,Fthe knitted three dimensional art has
OL,9,Fcaught the attention of toppers fans
OL,10,Facross the world.
OL,12,FIt's the work of Linda Jones, who said
OL,13,Fthe viral reaction from online had been
OL,14,F"tremendous".
